  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Legislative Institutions and Capacity for Inclusive Accountable Governance in Malaysia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project strengthens Malaysia&#x2019;s parliamentary and subnational legislative institutions by addressing structural vulnerabilities and enhancing the capacity of legislative actors to respond to political and policy challenges. It provides institutional support, targeted technical assistance, and capacity-building to: improve legislative checks and balances; uplift the research and analytical skills of parliamentary and subnational staff for evidence-based policymaking and oversight of public spending; enhance subnational legislatures&#x2019; institutional practices; advance inclusive political representation; and lay the groundwork for a future Parliamentary Budget Office. Together, these efforts aim to build more resilient, inclusive, and accountable democratic institutions</narrative>
  </description>
